review_comment:
@johnarnold sure, let's wait to get other opinions on this. There are also some storage considerations along with the change (think of a large JSON payload. e.g from an API call, as argument being passed to the task). Broker messages are ephemeral, but results may be desired to be retained for longer time in some occasions.

I am inclined to have the setting and a warning in the logs that this behavior will be the default from the next minor version onward. If that sounds like too much work, I can help with the implementation.

@thedrow @auvipy would like to share your opinion perhaps?

@thedrow Thanks for looking!   I did update the user guide, see:
https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/4490/files#diff-cc90971f3ec1a23279b1aa3e1426d247

Since it's internal, I changed it to task_name.

